# Shared runtime capacities. Defaults preserve the full system profile.
menu "Runtime object capacities"

config RUNTIME_MAX_TASKS
    int "max tasks"
    range 32 4096
    default 4096
    help
      Build-time capacity shared by both architectures. Reducing this limit
      can reduce reserved memory, but also limits concurrent workloads.
      The default preserves the full system configuration.

config RUNTIME_MAX_OPEN_FILES
    int "max open files"
    range 32 1024
    default 1024
    help
      Build-time capacity shared by both architectures. Reducing this limit
      can reduce reserved memory, but also limits concurrent workloads.
      The default preserves the full system configuration.

