config RUNTIME_MAX_INOTIFY_WATCHES
    int "max inotify watches"
    range 1 8192
    default 4096
    help
      Build-time capacity shared by both architectures. Reducing this limit
      can reduce reserved memory, but also limits concurrent workloads.
      The default supports systemd and a full graphical desktop. Small-memory
      profiles should select a lower fixed capacity.

